# ----------------------------------------
# 1. LOCAL SERVER & DATABASE CONFIG
# ----------------------------------------
PORT=3001
# URL for your local SQLite database
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

# Comma-separated list of allowed CORS origins, or leave unset for "*"
CORS_ORIGIN=

# ----------------------------------------
# 2. AZURE SECRETS (OpenAI + Speech)
# ----------------------------------------
# Azure OpenAI / Azure AI Speech keys are NOT set here. Copy
# `azure_stt_openai.env.template` to `azure_stt_openai.env` (gitignored) and
# fill those in - `src/loadEnv.ts` loads that file explicitly.
